<SNAP stateVersion="2" order="shift,space,drive,press" name="storm under concrete" tags="Dark,Huge,Kick" description="builds a rumbling low tail behind techno kicks: a low-only cellar reverb that ducks under each hit and swells after it, then dark tape drive and glue.">
